WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.150
[Soft ambient tones]
After hours. An exhibition after dark.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.000
Nocturne Hall. A crimson ring turns above a low platform.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.550
A spotlight illuminates Caravaggio’s The Lute Player.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.850
Scarlet Room. Red rings hang between paintings.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Henri Matisse’s Dance fills the frame.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.050
Night Garden. Floating forms sit beneath a loop of light.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.000
Obsidian Room. Faceted shapes hover above a white ring.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.850
Step inside. Four spaces. Art, a little closer.
